# SWX_AA tri-state (off/fxaa/smaa) with FXAA-off for BOTW 1.9.0 on macOS.
# The anchored fullscreen composite draw (scene -> canvas, fs key
# bd7ffdd435c6c3bc with vs 5e9f57168d89a543, prim 4, 3 verts, indexed,
# 1x/frame, PASSDUMP F3115-3117) is either left to the game or replaced by
# an inline copy pass: off skips the FXAA draw and copies the scene texel for
# texel when the sizes match, bilinear when they differ, RGB-only (mask 0x7;
# the alpha stays), honouring the canvas's pending clear. smaa runs the
# 3-pass filter on the scene, then the copy pass draws the filtered result
# into the canvas and the game draw is skipped. The sampler, coordinates,
# format and the game's RGB-only channel mask stay the draw's own. Interface:
# absent or fxaa = the game's FXAA (default); off AA off; smaa SMAA only; invalid
# falls back to fxaa with one warning; read once at launch; the installer
# leaves it absent (harness sets it per run). Anchor: the full FS key above,
# plus the VS key (unique pairing observed). Order with SWX_FXCAS: CAS
# sharpens first; SMAA/copy consume its output (the skipped draw's one-shot
# swap is disarmed in the hook).
# LUTs: AreaTex RG8Unorm 160x560 + SearchTex R8Unorm 64x16, original bytes
# (refs/mac-nativegames/games/totk/third_party/smaa at 71c806a838bdd7d, MIT
# License preserved in dm/gfx/msl/smaa.metal), uploaded once into immutable
# textures and reused across frames and scales. Copy shaders (swxaa_vs/copy/
# scale) live in smaa.metal, loaded by name (no runtime compile). Ordering
# through the core Metal 4 primitives (enc_r_begin/end barriers); recorder-safe
# (enc_r_*, rec_table, as copy_t2t_draw). Intermediates reuse only on confirmed
# GPU completion (slot ring vs g_done; idle wrong-size slots are re-created,
# replaced textures released). Validation mirrors
# refs/mac-nativegames/games/totk/third_party/d2r_gfx/gfx/nvn/botw_finish.h:50-99
# (2D source, source!=destination, single target, no blend, RGB-only mask 0x7,
# integral viewport/scissor; anything else keeps the game draw, logged once).
# verify: dm/gfx/msl/smaa.metal:smaa_weights
# verify: dm/gfx/msl/smaa.metal
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:swx_smaa_filter
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:k_swx_smaa_fs
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:SWX_AA=smaa
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:k_swx_smaa_area
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:static int swx_aa_hook
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:static int swx_aa_mode
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:strcmp(e, "off")
# verify: dm/games/settings.tsv:SWX_AA	choice
# verify: dm/games/settings.tsv:off=Off
# verify: dm/games/settings.py:'SWX_AA', 'DM_SCREEN_ASPECT'
# verify: dm/tools/tests/test_launcher_settings.py:mac['SWX_AA']
# verify: docs/launcher.schema.json:(DM|SWX)_[A-Z0-9_]+
